# eval outputs. Results policy (README, "Reproducibility"; CONTRIBUTING, "Results policy"): simulated
# runs are not versioned (CI and `cielo-bench reproduce --simulated` regenerate them). Real runs keep
# REPORT.md, summary.json, manifest.json, figures/ and trials.jsonl.gz (`cielo-bench pack`, which strips
# thinking signatures and provider ids); the raw trials.jsonl, scores.jsonl and cache/ stay local.
evals/runs/
results/*-simulated/
results/*/trials.jsonl
results/*/scores.jsonl
results/*/cache/

